<BaseLayout title="About" description="About Jobs SalaryPitcher — an independent, official-source-first government job notification service." canonicalPath="/about/">
  <h1>About {`Jobs SalaryPitcher`}</h1>
  <p>
    Jobs SalaryPitcher is an independent information service that tracks official Indian
    government job notifications and presents them in a clean, structured format with direct
    links to the source.
  </p>
  <h2>What we do</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Collect notifications from official government portals and weekly Employment News digests.</li>
    <li>Structure the key facts — posts, vacancies, eligibility, dates, fees — into easy-to-scan pages.</li>
    <li>Link every page to the official notification PDF and application portal.</li>
  </ul>
  <h2>What we don't do</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>We do not conduct recruitment or charge any fee.</li>
    <li>We do not publish job "news" or unverified claims — only what official sources state.</li>
  </ul>
  <p class="muted">
    Not affiliated with the Government of India or any recruitment body. Always rely on the
    official notification for authoritative details.
  </p>
</BaseLayout>
